# ── Sitemap ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Astro's sitemap integration emits /sitemap-index.xml, but /sitemap.xml is the
# conventional path: WordPress served it, Search Console had it submitted since
# 2017, and crawlers/SEO tools probe it by default. It 404'd from the cutover
# until 2026-08-15. Google follows redirects for sitemaps, so a 301 is enough —
# robots.txt still advertises /sitemap-index.xml directly.
/sitemap.xml                        /sitemap-index.xml      301

